<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 / 单题引擎</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>手把手教学循环与四种掌握状态</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={340} viewBox='0 0 700 340'><rect x='240' y='10' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='355' y='43' font-size='17' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>提出当前步骤的问题</text><line x1='355' y1='64' x2='355' y2='92' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='240' y='92' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='355' y='125' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学生尝试</text><line x1='355' y1='146' x2='355' y2='174' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='240' y='174' width='230' height='54' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='355' y='207' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>检查本步回答</text><path d='M240 201 L120 201 L120 120 L232 120' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M232 120 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><rect x='10' y='94' width='110' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='65' y='126' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>正确</text><text x='65' y='150' font-size='13' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>进入下一步</text><path d='M470 201 L620 201 L620 240 L472 240' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M472 240 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><rect x='530' y='214' width='100' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='580' y='246' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>不会</text><rect x='250' y='286' width='210' height='48' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='355' y='316' font-size='15' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>部分正确 / 错误：反馈并继续</text><line x1='355' y1='228' x2='355' y2='284' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>教学状态</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>系统可掌握：是否独立完成、尝试了几次、是否需要提示、是否看过答案、是否仍有具体错误。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>据此选择继续讲解、补充前置知识或安排步骤专项训练。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>四种状态：独立答对 / 提示后答对 / 看答案后完成 / 跳过与尚未完成。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>在提示下完成一步＝完成这次学习任务；在新题中独立完成同类步骤，才是更强的掌握证据。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>一次步骤错误并不能直接证明某知识点没有掌握。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：单题功能设计思路.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 30 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>